tive,” Mark brings more than 17 years of local experience and marketing innovation to Connecticut’s Gold Coast.</p><p>A pioneer in local real estate marketing, Mark was among the first in Fairfield County to introduce drone aerial photography to property listings in 2013. He is also the creator and host of Discover CT, a hyper-local video show highlighting neighborhoods, local lifestyles, local businesses, street interviews, and historic properties throughout Connecticut.</p><p>Beyond real estate, Mark is an accomplished content creator, motivational speaker known as Mark insPires, former MTV music artist, one-man-band singer-songwriter with more than 200 songs released, and patent-holding inventor of The BeatSeat percussion drum.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap grid"><div class="card"><h3>Direct Cell</h3><p><a style="color:#d4af37" href="tel:2032472655">203-247-2655</a></p></div><div class="card"><h3>Office</h3><p>Coldwell Banker Realty<br>1508 Post Rd<br>Fairfield, CT 06824<br><a style="color:#d4af37" href="mailto:mark.pires@cbrealty.com">mark.pires@cbrealty.com</a></p></div></div></section><section class="funnels"><div class="wrap"><h2>How Mark Can Help</h2><div class="funnel-grid"><div class="funnel"><h3>Selling</h3><p>Get a real local pricing and marketing review.</p><a class="btn" href="/#home-value">Get Home Value</a></div><div class="funnel"><h3>Buying</h3><p>Search Fairfield County with direct local guidance.</p><a class="btn" href="/buyer-funnel.php">Buyer Help</a></div><div class="funnel"><h3>Relocating</h3><p>Compare towns, commute, schools and lifestyle.</p><a class="btn" href="/buyer-funnel.php?type=relocation">Relocating to CT</a></div></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><p>Serving Fairfield, Westport, Greenwich, Old Greenwich, Stamford, Darien, New Canaan, Wilton, Easton, Norwalk and lower Fairfield County.</p></div></section></body></html>